<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assŭētūdo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ads-</span></b> ; v. assuesco <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>init.</i>),
			ĭnis, f.
			assuetus, <i>a being accustomed to</i> a
			thing, <i>custom</i>, <i>habit.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic.): amor adsuetudinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 9</span></i>
			, 
			 § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">20 Müll.: longāque alit
					assuetudine flammas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nil adsuetudine majus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					A. 2, 345</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adsuetudo mali,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 26, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">27, 39</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">44, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">seu naturā sive adsuetudine suspensa
					et obscura verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					1, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">confarreandi adsuetudo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adsuetudo voluptatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					2, 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					6, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">furandi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 11, 18, 17</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp. in mal. part. (v. assuesco, II.), <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 13,
				46</span></i>.</div>
